    <string name="rule_delay_explanation">Default waiting time before a permissive change takes effect, including turning off or pausing protection. An app can have its own rule delay. Blocking access or increasing a delay takes effect immediately.\n\nEnter 0 for no delay. Maximum: 7 days. Reducing a delay waits for the difference: 6 hours to 4 hours waits 2 hours. A pause or temporary rule starts its duration after the waiting period.</string>
    <string name="rule_delay_invalid">Enter 0 or more, up to 7 days. Use at most 3 digits before the decimal and 2 after it.</string>
